The generator is now locally complete and reverified: inverse generation yields a unique witness, all G1–G9 local gates pass, the exact legal-guess probability is \(1/847{,}660{,}528\), all four in-context attacks are 0/8, and the disclosed meet-in-the-middle reference solver succeeds 8/8 after about 1.17 million state visits on average. The sole missing evidence is external: the oracle ladder aborted after `easy` was solved because the second vendor remained quota-blocked.
